1
00:00:00,427 --> 00:00:03,097
(Sheldon:)I shook my booty
to the seductive rhythms...

2
00:00:03,096 --> 00:00:04,666
(Penny:)Okay, okay.

3
00:00:04,665 --> 00:00:06,395
(Shldon:)...of AP Calculus.

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,570
(Raj:)How come you're not shopping
with Amy and Bernadette?

5
00:00:11,571 --> 00:00:14,311
(Leonard:)Let me guess, you think
the whole idea is lame?

6
00:00:14,308 --> 00:00:15,838
(Penny:)Well, who cares what I think?
What do you think?

7
00:00:15,842 --> 00:00:17,842
(Leonard:)Hmm, to be honest,

8
00:00:17,844 --> 00:00:21,014
(Leonard:)it's kind of a dream come true
to go to even a fake prom

9
00:00:21,014 --> 00:00:22,444
(Leonard:)with a woman
as beautiful as you.

10
00:00:22,449 --> 00:00:25,279
(Penny:)Ugh, thanks a lot.

11
00:00:25,285 --> 00:00:27,015
(Leonard:)What?

12
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:31,190
(Penny:)Well, now I can't blow this
thing off without being a bitch.

13
00:00:31,191 --> 00:00:33,521
That sounds like a "yes"!

14
00:00:36,496 --> 00:00:39,696
(Bernadette:)Ooh, every single person
RSVP'd "yes."

15
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,430
This is so exciting!

16
00:00:41,435 --> 00:00:43,865
(higher pitched):
Isn't this exciting?

17
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:45,400
(dog howls)

18
00:00:47,007 --> 00:00:48,477
(Howard:)Yep.

19
00:00:48,475 --> 00:00:50,845
(Bernadette:)Look, even Stuart's
bringing a date.

20
00:00:50,844 --> 00:00:52,014
(Bernadette:)I wonder who it is.

21
00:00:52,012 --> 00:00:53,782
(Howard:)You know exactly
who it is.

22
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,310
(Howard:)He's gonna bring my mom.

23
00:00:55,315 --> 00:00:56,645
(Howard:)Why did you even invite him?

24
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:59,350
(Bernadette:)Because he's our friend,
and you two need to get along.

25
00:00:59,353 --> 00:01:00,953
(Bernadette:)And why can't
he take your mom?

